.vs/

# Canon's EDSDK redistributable, which is NOT ours to commit or redistribute.
# Canon.EDSDK.csproj packs lib/win-x86|win-x64/EDSDK.dll into runtimes/<rid>/native, so an
# accidental `git add -A` would ship a proprietary Canon binary inside a public NuGet package.
# It has never been tracked; this only makes that permanent. Obtain it from Canon's Developer
# Community and drop it in lib/win-x64/ (see README) - the Exists() conditions pack it when
# present and skip it when not, so nothing here is required to compile.
lib/**/EDSDK.dll
